{"title": "Scale Mail", "pageid": 3524, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scale_Mail", "categories": ["Medium Armour", "Common items", "Inaccessible"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scale_Mail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scale_Mail_Icon.png/300px-Scale_Mail_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/8/8d/Scale_Mail_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scale Mail image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scale_Mail_Icon.png/300px-Scale_Mail_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Scale_Mail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scale Mail</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Medium_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium Armour</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A hefty shirt of scale, offering some pro