izing:border-box;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}</style><table class=\"ambox ambox-notice plainlinks metadata\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png/300px-Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scale Mail image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png/300px-Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Scale_Mail_Flaming_Fist_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scale Mail</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Medium_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium Armour</a> worn by some members of the <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A hefty shirt of scale, offering some protection against the slings and arrows of the world.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties_2\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 14\">14</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a> <i>(max +2)</i></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><